      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GINGERIFFIC (7) finished out of the money two starts back then she settled well back when fourth over 1000m at Broome two-and-a-half weeks ago. Won't find this as tough so she is one of the main contenders. ENVENOMATE (3) is racing well. Scored at Darwin two back then finished second, beaten 2.5 lengths, over 1350m at this track at the latest appearance a week ago. Leading contender. MUMMSIE (8) hasn't been able to break through for an extended period, the latest effort a sixth over 1600m at this track. Nicely placed to turn things around. WARREGO (2) missed the placings when resuming two runs back then did a good job last start but found one better over 1100m at this track, beaten only 1.2 lengths. Nicely placed to take this out. I'M A DREAMER (5) was too good first-up and can build on that performance.",
